]
Call the representation HB-nonsplittable if

(a) no submultiset of (3) has product in [Q^a,Q^b]; and

(b) for every r with 1<=r<=j-1,
[
 n/u_rge Q^a.                                                   	ag{4}
]

Among the submultisets of (3) whose product is at most Q^b, choose one whose product P is numerically maximal; among ties choose one maximal by inclusion, and then use any fixed final tie-break. Every HB-nonsplittable representation has
[
