]
every d_i, including every d_i=1, belongs to the chosen submultiset, and at least two omitted factors are nonunit members of
[
 {u_1,ldots,u_{j-1},t}.                                     	ag{6}
]
Every omitted factor y in (6) satisfies the sharper bound
[
