\]
No condition between \(m,t\) is imposed. Let
\[
 \sum_\rho\eta_\rho A_\rho(q)C_\rho(m)D_\rho(t)E_\rho(h)       \tag{2}
\]
be the exact complete-provenance projective expansion supplied by fact \(544c7ba4db45c06f\) for the literal Fourier/Archimedean coefficient on this box.

For a Dirichlet character \(\chi\pmod q\), extended by zero on nonunits, define
\[
