\]
Let
\[
 \langle u,v\rangle_q=\sum_{\chi\pmod q}u(\chi)\overline{v(\chi)}.
\]
Then the exact contribution of this projective box to ULTRA-LONG-MU-\(N\) is
\[
 \boxed{
