]
For (kge2) and (yge1), define
[
 Gamma_{k;L,S}(y)=
 { f1}_{substack{y {m squarefree}\omega(y)=k\P^+(y)le L\S<y}}
  rac1k#{p:pmid y, p {m prime}, y/ple S}. 	ag{4}
]
Then exactly one of the following alternatives applies.

(A) (j_I(r)>0), and
[
