Let \(\mathfrak L\) be exactly the finite fixed-\(U\), high-label, dyadic, smooth, logarithmic, forward-parent, least-tag and normalized-marker copy inventory retained in fact fc442085ff47a053; it is not enlarged by arbitrary weights. For \(\iota\in\mathfrak L\), let \(\kappa_\iota(n,h,p,\ell)\) be its exact signed copy coefficient times all its literal zero-one masks, extended by zero whenever a mask fails. Let \(F_{\iota,n,p\ell}\) be the \(g=1,d=n,r=p\ell\) specialization of the literal smooth source function \(F_{g,a,b}\) in fact 0a39d6be778e7dc9, with the smooth weight belonging to \(\iota\). Thus all source logarithms and smooth cutoffs remain inside \(\widehat F_{\iota,n,p\ell}\). Put
\[
 C_\iota(n;h,p,\ell)=
