Assume the hypotheses and notation of facts 0fd3b33d63081ee3, 4d26de51cb52d44d and 70f0948e686a21c8. Write the exact projector identity of fact 70f0948e686a21c8 as
[
 Pi_a=L_a+D_a,qquad
 L_a=E_aA_a,quad A_a=P_a(F/a),qquad
 D_a= rac{B_a}{a-1},quad B_a=P_a(F/a)-P_a(F),             	ag{1}
]
and analogously for b. Use the convention that a mode bit is one for L and zero for D:
[
 egin{aligned}
