 widetilde M_{10}&=L_aoverline{D_b},\
 widetilde M_{01}&=D_aoverline{L_b},&
 widetilde M_{00}&=D_aoverline{D_b}.                       	ag{2}
end{aligned}
]
Then this is only a relabelling of fact 70f0948e686a21c8:
[
