It remains to audit the principal (widetilde M_{11}) pair support. Use the exact notation of fact 70f0948e686a21c8:
[
 c=(m,h),qquad q=m/c,qquad t=h/c,qquad u_j=p_jell_j,
 qquad u_2-u_1=q	au.                                      	ag{11}
]
On the clean nonzero-selector support put
[
 A=Nt(a-b).
]
Then ((A,ab)=1), and the exact finite part of the paired phase is
[
 e_{ab}!left(A	au(u_1u_2)^{-1}ight).                   	ag{12}
]
Its reduced additive conductor is exactly
[
  rac{ab}{(ab,	au)}.                                      	ag{13}
]
Hence the four disjoint conductor strata are
[
 egin{array}{c|c}
 (a,	au)=(b,	au)=1&ab\
 amid	au, b
mid	au&b\
 bmid	au, a
mid	au&a\
