e u_2, (u_1,u_2) hbox{is one prime}.               	ag{16}
]
These are respectively the arithmetic diagonal, the four-distinct-prime sector, and the shared-star sector. The residue parametrization (11) deletes none of them; every pre-existing collision mask remains inside the two literal source rows. Likewise, (14) is a partition, not a deletion: the one-prime and trivial conductor-drop sectors remain part of the principal aggregate.

Let
